      "message": "Does modifying this fd_ affect other log sources\u0027s write to STDERR and STDOUT?\n\nAfter Rewind(), don\u0027t we need to fast forward it towards the end to restore its state?\n\nAlso, if this affects other log sources, what if another thread is writing to the fd_ while we Rewind(), would there be chances for race conditions? (maybe not a case if this fd_ does not affect others since this is read only)",
