        "id": 1106424
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-15T21:54:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thats exactly what I wanted to do originally.\n\nI tried using poll/epoll but they can\u0027t be used with fds for regular files (they return EPERM error).\n\nI would argue that 10ms is still way better than arbitrarily putting 1s and 2s timeouts in the unit test code.\n\nAlso, there are two scenarios:\n\n1. log line was printed before we started checking\n2. log line is printed after we start checking\n\nWe need to handle both.",
      "parentUuid": "9da58f57_b54b7484",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 131,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 131,
        "endChar": 65
